            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.7.1+DEU.7.2+DEU.7.3+DEU.7.4+DEU.7.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kumbukumbu 7:1–5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku zizo piya naona Ayahudi ariokala akalóla achetu a Chiashidodi, Chiamoni na a Chimoabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nusu ya ana aho taayaweza kugomba Chiyahudi ela agomba Chiashidodi ama luga zanjina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nchiademurira na kualani. Anjina náapiga na nchiamwatsula nyere. Nchiahenda aape kpwa Mlungu, nchiamba, “Tamundaalóza ana enu achetu avulana ao, wala kualóza avulana enu asichana ao, wala kualóla mwimwi enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.12.24+2SA.12.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Samueli 12:24–25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.11.1+1KI.11.2+1KI.11.3+1KI.11.4+1KI.11.5+1KI.11.6+1KI.11.7+1KI.11.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Afalume 11:1–8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dze, Mfalume Selemani kayahenda dambi kpwa sababu ya achetu dza aha? Kahi ya go mataifa ganjina manji takukarire na afalume dza iye. Mlunguwe wammendza na achimuhenda mfalume wa Iziraeli yosi, ela hata vivyo achitiywa dambini ni achetu ambao si Ayahudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dze, swino hukuphundzeni mwimwi na huhende uyi huno mkpwulu na kukosa uaminifu kpwa Mlungu wehu kpwa kulóla achetu asiokala Ayahudi?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
