            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwana mmwenga wa Jehoyada mwana wa mlavyadzi-sadaka mkpwulu Eliashibu kala ni mtsedza wa Sanibalati Muhoroni, kpwa hivyo nchimzola.",
          "type": "text",
